## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical familiarity with event-driven GCP components (Cloud Functions, Cloud Tasks, Cloud Run) and basic dataflow between storage and analytics. It also probes idempotency, IAM least privilege, and retry strategies.

## Key Concepts
- Event-driven ingestion and validation in Cloud Functions
- Cloud Tasks as a reliable, retryable trigger for Cloud Run
- Serverless image processing in Cloud Run with GCS I/O
- Deterministic naming and idempotency via insertId
- Minimal IAM configuration and proper service accounts

